    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if the \"standard\" presentation is usually for fair-skinned people, how does it actually look in a patient with a darker skin tone, like someone who is Black or African American? are there different visual cues i should be looking for instead of the ABCDE stuff?",
